isplay-bold,playfair display,serif;" class="wixui-rich-text__text"><span style="color:#FFFFFF;" class="wixui-rich-text__text"><span style="font-size:75px;" class="wixui-rich-text__text">The Domain of Valbonne</span></span></span></h1></div><!--/$--><!--$--><div id="comp-le313auy1" class="N8MGzv _v6ohL PO9MfV AWXfZq comp-le313auy1 wixui-rich-text" data-testid="richTextElement"><p class="font_7 wixui-rich-text__text" style="font-size:35px; line-height:1.67em; text-align:center;"><span style="font-size:35px;" class="wixui-rich-text__text"><span style="font-family:playfair display,serif;" class="wixui-rich-text__text"><span style="color:rgb(255, 255, 255);" class="wixui-rich-text__text">An exceptional place for an unforgettable wedding</span></span></span></p> 
<p class="font_7 wixui-rich-text__text" style="font-size:35px; line-height:1.67em; text-align:center;"><span style="font-size:35px;" class="wixui-rich-text__text"><span style="font-family:playfair display,serif;" class="wixui-rich-text__text"><span style="color:rgb(255, 255, 255);" class="wixui-rich-text__text">in Occitan Provence</span></span></span></p></div><!--/$--><!--$--><div class="comp-le313auz mu5PoX" id="comp-le313auz" aria-disabled="false"><a data-testid="linkElement" href="https://www.domainedevalbonne.com/le-domaine" target="_self" class="twJknM wixui-button ZhVEJq" aria-disabled="false" aria-label="DISCOVER"><span class="OR4Nv8 wixui-button__label">DISCOVER</span></a></div><!--/$--></div></div></div><!--/$--><div data-mesh-id="comp-lesxngkjinlineContent-wedge-3"></div></div></div></section><!--/$--><!--$--><section id="comp-le32ldti" tabindex="-1" class="Le88gL comp-le32ldti wixui-section" data-block-level-container="ClassicSection"><div id="bgLayers_comp-le32ldti" data-hook="bgLayers" data-motion-part="BG_LAYER comp-le32ldti" class="QG9w8P"><div data-testid="colorUnderlay" class="LNYVZi ayCf9D"></div><div id="bgMedia_comp-le32ldti" data-motion-part="BG_MEDIA comp-le32ldti" class="ROWgFb"></div></div><div data-mesh-id="comp-le32ldtiinlineContent" data-testid="inline-content" class=""><div data-mesh-id="comp-le32ldtiinlineContent-gridContainer" data-testid="mesh-container-content"><!--$--><div id="comp-lgdexk5o" class="comp-lgdexk5o wH18kY"><div data-mesh-id="comp-lgdexk5oinlineContent" data-testid="inline-content" class=""><div data-mesh-id="comp-lgdexk5oinlineContent-gridContainer" data-testid="mesh-container-content"><!--$--><div id="comp-le32mh6f" class="N8MGzv _v6ohL PO9MfV AWXfZq comp-le32mh6f wixui-rich-text" data-testid="richTextElement"><h2 class="font_2 wixui-rich-text__text" style="font-size:45px;"><span style="font-size:45px;" class="wixui-rich-text__text"><span style="font-family:playfair display,serif;" class="wixui-rich-text__text">An exceptional Domain</span></span></h2></div><!--/$--><!--$--><div id="comp-le34o3ye" class="N8MGzv _v6ohL PO9MfV AWXfZq comp-le34o3ye wixui-rich-text" data-testid="richTextElement"><h3 class="font_3 wixui-rich-text__text" style="font-size:20px;"><span style="font-size:20px;" class="wixui-rich-text__text"><span style="font-style:italic;" class="wixui-rich-text__text"><span style="font-family:playfair display,serif;" class="wixui-rich-text__text">borrowing from history</span></span></span></h3></div><!--/$--><!--$--><div id="comp-le32mtal" class="N8MGzv _v6ohL PO9MfV AWXfZq comp-le32mtal wixui-rich-text" data-testid="richTextElement"><p class="font_7 wixui-rich-text__text" style="font-size:15px;"><span style="font-size:15px;" class="wixui-rich-text__text"><span style="font-family:arial,ｍｓ ｐゴシック,ms pgothic,돋움,dotum,helvetica,sans-serif;" class="wixui-rich-text__text">This Mas Provençal was baptized Mas de Valbonne after the 4200 acres national forest that borders the estate. Built in the 16th century, its primary activity was the cultivation of silkworms.</span></span></p> 
<p class="font_7 wixui-rich-text__text" style="font-size:15px;">&nbsp;</p> 
<p class="font_7 wixui-rich-text__text" style="font-size:15px;"><span style="font-size:15px;" class="wixui-rich-text__text"><span style="font-family:arial,ｍｓ ｐゴシック,ms pgothic,돋움,dotum,helvetica,sans-serif;" class="wixui-rich-text__text">This Estate, which extends over an area of 35 hectares, offers a panoramic view of the olive trees, vineyards, truffle oaks, lavender fields.</span></span></p></div><!--/$--><!--$--><div id="comp-le34wu08" class="comp-le34wu08" data-semantic-classname="button"><a data-testid="linkElement" href="https://www.domainedevalbonne.com/le-domaine" target="_self" class="StylableButton2545352419__root style-leszinoa__root wixui-button StylableButton2545352419__link" aria-label="DISCOVER THE DOMAIN"><span class="StylableButton2545352419__container"><span class="StylableButton2545352419__label wixui-button__label" data-testid="stylablebutton-label">DISCOVER THE DOMAIN</span><span class="StylableButton2545352419__icon wixui-button__icon" aria-hidden="true" data-testid="stylablebutton-icon"><span><svg data-bbox="13.05 2.55 33.878 54.8" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 60 60">
