 class="wixui-rich-text__text">Character &amp; elegance</span></span></h2></div><!--/$--><!--$--><div id="comp-le354ky1" class="N8MGzv _v6ohL PO9MfV AWXfZq comp-le354ky1 wixui-rich-text" data-testid="richTextElement"><h3 class="font_3 wixui-rich-text__text" style="font-size:20px;"><span style="font-style:italic;" class="wixui-rich-text__text"><span style="font-size:20px;" class="wixui-rich-text__text"><span style="font-family:playfair display,serif;" class="wixui-rich-text__text">Hamlet with its houses</span></span></span></h3></div><!--/$--><!--$--><div id="comp-le354xvx" class="N8MGzv _v6ohL PO9MfV AWXfZq comp-le354xvx wixui-rich-text" data-testid="richTextElement"><p class="font_7 wixui-rich-text__text" style="font-size:15px;">Dating from the 16th century, the historic building of the Domaine de Valbonne forms a true Provençal hamlet, with its stone dwellings, alcoves, charming little passages and intimate corners.<br class="wixui-rich-text__text"> The elegant, light-filled courtyards enhance this unique southern French village atmosphere, ideal for welcoming your guests in a warm and exotic setting.</p> 
<p class="font_7 wixui-rich-text__text" style="font-size:15px;">The Domaine's accommodations consist of a spacious main farmhouse, including the bridal suite, as well as very comfortable accommodations with beautiful independent bedrooms, recently renovated.<br class="wixui-rich-text__text"> The complex offers high-end accommodation, designed to host families, friends and guests for a wedding in Provence, a private event or a stay with loved ones.</p> 
<p class="font_7 wixui-rich-text__text" style="font-size:15px;"><span class="wixGuard wixui-rich-text__text">​</span></p></div><!--/$--><!--$--><div id="comp-le359o9u" class="comp-le359o9u" data-semantic-classname="button"><a data-testid="linkElement" href="https://www.domainedevalbonne.com/contact" target="_self" class="StylableButton2545352419__root style-leszieh3__root wixui-button StylableButton2545352419__link" aria-label="CONTACT US"><span class="StylableButton2545352419__container"><span class="StylableButton2545352419__label wixui-button__label" data-testid="stylablebutton-label">CONTACT US</span><span class="StylableButton2545352419__icon wixui-button__icon" aria-hidden="true" data-testid="stylablebutton-icon"><span><svg data-bbox="13.05 2.55 33.878 54.8" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 60 60">
    <g>
