l9.29 9.29L0 19.285l.707.707 9.29-9.29 9.289 9.29.707-.707-9.29-9.29 9.29-9.289L19.286 0l-9.29 9.29z" transform="translate(1 1)" stroke-linecap="round" fill-rule="evenodd"></path></svg></div></button></div></div><div data-focus-guard="true" tabindex="-1" style="width:1px;height:0px;padding:0;overflow:hidden;position:fixed;top:1px;left:1px"></div></div></div></div></div></div><div class="o2HYMd EWjvBx hsuzbd"><div class="vbxyIl hxEonB"></div><div class="mFmg_g" data-hook=""><div class="w5CKMg knXXuc"></div></div><div class="vbxyIl ZCVXWy"></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><!--/$--></div></div></section><!--/$--><!--$--><section id="comp-le6v6d9m" tabindex="-1" class="Le88gL comp-le6v6d9m wixui-section" data-block-level-container="ClassicSection"><div id="bgLayers_comp-le6v6d9m" data-hook="bgLayers" data-motion-part="BG_LAYER comp-le6v6d9m" class="QG9w8P"><div data-testid="colorUnderlay" class="LNYVZi ayCf9D"></div><div id="bgMedia_comp-le6v6d9m" data-motion-part="BG_MEDIA comp-le6v6d9m" class="ROWgFb"></div></div><div data-mesh-id="comp-le6v6d9minlineContent" data-testid="inline-content" class=""><div data-mesh-id="comp-le6v6d9minlineContent-gridContainer" data-testid="mesh-container-content"><!--$--><div id="comp-le6vb0w5" class="N8MGzv _v6ohL PO9MfV AWXfZq comp-le6vb0w5 wixui-rich-text" data-testid="richTextElement"><h2 class="font_2 wixui-rich-text__text" style="font-size:45px;"><span style="font-size:45px;" class="wixui-rich-text__text"><span style="font-family:playfair display,serif;" class="wixui-rich-text__text">Location</span></span></h2></div><!--/$--><!--$--><div id="comp-le6vdw8p" class="N8MGzv _v6ohL PO9MfV AWXfZq comp-le6vdw8p wixui-rich-text" data-testid="richTextElement"><h3 class="font_3 wixui-rich-text__text" style="font-size:20px;"><span style="font-style:italic;" class="wixui-rich-text__text"><span style="font-size:20px;" class="wixui-rich-text__text"><span style="font-family:playfair display,serif;" class="wixui-rich-text__text">The typical small villages</span></span></span></h3></div><!--/$--><!--$--><div id="comp-le6vf2ph" class="N8MGzv _v6ohL PO9MfV AWXfZq comp-le6vf2ph wixui-rich-text" data-testid="richTextElement"><p class="font_7 wixui-rich-text__text" style="font-size:15px;">Ideally located in the heart of the Valbonne state forest, the Domaine de Valbonne enjoys a privileged position between Provence, the Gard region along the Rhône, and the Ardèche gorges. Just a few kilometers from the old medieval town of Pont-Saint-Esprit, the Domaine is nestled in an authentic, unspoiled, and typically Provençal setting.</p> 
<p class="font_7 wixui-rich-text__text" style="font-size:15px;">The village of Saint-Paulet-de-Caisson, where the Domaine is nestled, offers a remarkable natural setting: vineyards, holm oaks, and garrigue fragrant with thyme, rosemary, and wild lavender. An ideal Mediterranean atmosphere for a wedding in Provence or a getaway in the south of France.</p> 
<p class="font_7 wixui-rich-text__text" style="font-size:15px;">In the immediate vicinity, you can discover the most beautiful villages of the Cèze valley and the Gard region of Provence:<br class="wixui-rich-text__text"> La Roque-sur-Cèze, Aiguèze, Montclus, but also many picturesque hamlets classified among the most beautiful villages in France.</p> 
<p class="font_7 wixui-rich-text__text" style="font-size:15px;">The nearest major cities – Avignon, Orange, Nîmes and Montélimar – allow for easy and quick access.<br class="wixui-rich-text__text"> Domaine de Valbonne is located just 15 minutes from the nearest train station and motorway, making it easy for your guests to arrive from all over France and abroad.</p></div><!--/$--><!--$--><div id="comp-le6v98ru" class="W4V2qg comp-le6v98ru wixui-image" title="Seb Pochet"><div data-testid="linkElement" class="apPOZK"><img loading="lazy" sizes="497px" srcSet="https://static.wixstatic.com/media/314229_2bbe3427abbc48f2a392b84aac1552bb~mv2.png/v1/fill/w_497,h_600,al_c,q_85,usm_0.66_1.00_0.01,enc_avif,quality_auto/314229_2bbe3427abbc48f2a392b84aac1552bb~mv2.png 1x, https://static.wixstatic.com/media/314229_2bbe3427abbc48f2a392b84aac1552bb~mv2.png/v1/fill/w_640,h_773,al_c,lg_1,q_90,enc_avif,quality_auto/314229_2bbe3427abbc48f2a392b84aac1552bb~mv2.png 2x" id="img_comp-le6v98ru" src="https://static.wixstatic.com/media/314229_2bbe3427abbc48f2a392b84aac1552bb~mv2.png/v1/fill/w_497,h_600,al_c,q_85,usm_0.66_1.00_0.01,enc_avif,quality_auto/314229_2bbe3427abbc48f2a392b84aac1552bb~mv2.png" alt="Places to visit around the Domaine de Valbonne: Provençal villages, vineyards, the Ardèche gorges and tourist sites of the" style="object-fit:cover" class="gRkIq0 sFiSiq" width="497" height="600"/></div></div><!--/$--><!--$--><div id="comp-le6vgus1" class="comp-le6vgus1" data-semantic-classname="button"><a data-testid="linkElement" href="https://www.domainedevalbonne.com/mariage-en-provence" target="_self" class="StylableButton2545352419__root style-leszhpx8__root wixui-button StylableButton2545352419__link" aria-label="DISCOVER THE REGION"><span class="StylableButton2545352419__container"><span class="StylableButton2545352419__label wixui-button__label" data-testid="stylablebutton-label">DISCOVER THE REGION</span><span class="StylableButton2545352419__icon wixui-button__icon" aria-hidden="true" data-testid="stylablebutton-icon"><span><svg data-bbox="13.05 2.55 33.878 54.8" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 60 60">
