__text">Your stay in rooms<br class="wixui-rich-text__text"> high-end</span></span></h2></div><!--/$--><!--$--><div id="comp-le74b7qm" class="N8MGzv _v6ohL PO9MfV AWXfZq comp-le74b7qm wixui-rich-text" data-testid="richTextElement"><p class="font_7 wixui-rich-text__text" style="font-size:15px;">At Domaine de Valbonne, we offer a range of upscale accommodations for up to <span style="font-weight:bold;" class="wixui-rich-text__text">56 people, including 23 elegant bedrooms, 17 bathrooms, and 23 toilets</span> —ideal for a wedding, seminar, or holiday in Provence. Several rooms also feature <span style="font-weight:bold;" class="wixui-rich-text__text">air conditioning</span> , a welcome feature on hot Provençal days.</p> 
<p class="font_7 wixui-rich-text__text" style="font-size:15px;">The main farmhouse, the true heart of the hamlet, offers vast, warm spaces, a living room with a fireplace, and a large bridal suite designed to combine comfort, privacy, and Provençal authenticity.</p> 
<p class="font_7 wixui-rich-text__text" style="font-size:15px;">The adjacent accommodations complete the ensemble with magnificent, high-end bedrooms. Each unit has its own lovely private terrace, allowing guests to fully enjoy the gentle Provence climate and the soothing views of the estate.</p></div><!--/$--><!--$--><div id="comp-le74iyr8" class="comp-le74iyr8" data-semantic-classname="button"><a data-testid="linkElement" href="https://www.domainedevalbonne.com/hebergements" target="_self" class="StylableButton2545352419__root style-leszhee5__root wixui-button StylableButton2545352419__link" aria-label="ACCOMMODATION"><span class="StylableButton2545352419__container"><span class="StylableButton2545352419__label wixui-button__label" data-testid="stylablebutton-label">ACCOMMODATION</span><span class="StylableButton2545352419__icon wixui-button__icon" aria-hidden="true" data-testid="stylablebutton-icon"><span><svg data-bbox="13.05 2.55 33.878 54.8" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 60 60">
