uYL9xS"><div class="JMCi2v blog-post-post-list-link-hashtag-hover-color so9KdE lyd6fK I5nSmk"><a class="O16KGI pu51Xe lyd6fK xs2MeC" href="https://www.domainedevalbonne.com/post/story-scottish-wedding-at-domaine-de-valbonne"><div style="font-size:25px" class="FbwBsX blog-post-title-font lyd6fK p8Uk20 xs2MeC HhgCcE" data-hook="post-list-item__title"><div class="T5UMT5 fcPJ4D blog-hover-container-element-color I9XQQf post-title blog-post-post-list-title-color blog-post-post-list-title-font _wPn3X" style="font-size:25px" data-hook="post-title"><h2 class="bD0vt9 KNiaIk" style="-webkit-line-clamp:3">Story - Scottish Wedding at Domaine de Valbonne</h2></div></div></a><div class="CHRJex JMCi2v pu51Xe lyd6fK xs2MeC"><div style="font-size:15px" class="nebVix lyd6fK p8Uk20 blog-post-description-style-font blog-post-post-list-description-style-font mABNle HhgCcE" data-hook="post-description"><div class="wR7PET"><div class="BOlnTh" style="-webkit-line-clamp:3">If you’re a UK or US couple dreaming of a chic destination wedding in Provence , Domaine de Valbonne is one of the most enchanting venues in the South of France. Known for its golden light, warm autumn colours, and timeless Provençal charm, the estate is especially magical for an October wedding , when the sun casts soft orange tones over the vineyards and stone buildings. Surrounded by olive trees, lavender fields, vineyards, and beautifully restored historic houses , the Do</div></div></div></div></div><div class="CS4xCt JGhsWK" data-hook="post-category-label"><a class="Ym42pV SkWvPq" href="https://www.domainedevalbonne.com/news/categories/mariage-2">Wedding</a></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div data-key="items-styles" style="display:none"></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><!--/$--><!--$--><div id="comp-le758c10" class="comp-le758c10" data-semantic-classname="button"><a data-testid="linkElement" href="https://www.domainedevalbonne.com/news" target="_self" class="StylableButton2545352419__root style-let07myn__root wixui-button StylableButton2545352419__link" aria-label="SEE ALL ITEMS"><span class="StylableButton2545352419__container"><span class="StylableButton2545352419__label wixui-button__label" data-testid="stylablebutton-label">SEE ALL ITEMS</span><span class="StylableButton2545352419__icon wixui-button__icon" aria-hidden="true" data-testid="stylablebutton-icon"><span><svg data-bbox="13.05 2.55 33.878 54.8" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 60 60">
    <g>
        <path d="M46.5 28.9L20.6 3c-.6-.6-1.6-.6-2.2 0l-4.8 4.8c-.6.6-.6 1.6 0 2.2l19.8 20-19.9 19.9c-.6.6-.6 1.6 0 2.2l4.8 4.8c.6.6 1.6.6 2.2 0l21-21 4.8-4.8c.8-.6.8-1.6.2-2.2z"></path>
