</span></span></span></a></div><!--/$--></div></div></section><!--/$--><!--$--><section id="comp-le754yab" tabindex="-1" class="Le88gL comp-le754yab wixui-section" data-block-level-container="ClassicSection"><div id="bgLayers_comp-le754yab" data-hook="bgLayers" data-motion-part="BG_LAYER comp-le754yab" class="QG9w8P"><div data-testid="colorUnderlay" class="LNYVZi ayCf9D"></div><div id="bgMedia_comp-le754yab" data-motion-part="BG_MEDIA comp-le754yab" class="ROWgFb"></div></div><div data-mesh-id="comp-le754yabinlineContent" data-testid="inline-content" class=""><div data-mesh-id="comp-le754yabinlineContent-gridContainer" data-testid="mesh-container-content"><!--$--><div id="comp-le759xg5" class="N8MGzv _v6ohL PO9MfV AWXfZq comp-le759xg5 wixui-rich-text" data-testid="richTextElement"><h2 class="font_2 wixui-rich-text__text" style="font-size:45px; text-align:center;"><span class="color_16 wixui-rich-text__text"><span style="font-size:45px;" class="wixui-rich-text__text"><span style="font-family:playfair display,serif;" class="wixui-rich-text__text">Welcome to Domaine de Valbonne</span></span></span></h2></div><!--/$--><!--$--><div id="comp-le75aq1y" class="N8MGzv _v6ohL PO9MfV AWXfZq comp-le75aq1y wixui-rich-text" data-testid="richTextElement"><h3 class="font_3 wixui-rich-text__text" style="font-size:18px; text-align:center;"><span style="color:#F3F3F3;" class="wixui-rich-text__text"><span style="font-size:18px;" class="wixui-rich-text__text"><span style="font-weight:normal;" class="wixui-rich-text__text"><span style="font-family:playfair-display-v2,serif;" class="wixui-rich-text__text">An exceptional place in Provence, designed and renovated with passion</span></span></span></span></h3></div><!--/$--><!--$--><div id="comp-le75ceig" class="N8MGzv _v6ohL PO9MfV AWXfZq comp-le75ceig wixui-rich-text" data-testid="richTextElement"><p class="font_7 wixui-rich-text__text" style="font-size:15px; text-align:center;"><span class="color_44 wixui-rich-text__text">As proud owners of Domaine de Valbonne for over five years, we are committed to preserving and enhancing this authentic place so that you feel “at home” while offering your guests a memorable experience.</span></p> 
<p class="font_7 wixui-rich-text__text" style="text-align:center; font-size:15px;"><span class="color_44 wixui-rich-text__text">Completely renovated in 2021, the Domaine undergoes improvements every winter: new facilities, comfort work, redesigned spaces… always in a spirit of chic country and Provençal elegance.</span></p> 
<p class="font_7 wixui-rich-text__text" style="text-align:center; font-size:15px;"><span class="color_44 wixui-rich-text__text">We have designed different reception areas to create varied atmospheres: shaded places, clearings, olive trees, village courtyards, swimming pools, vaulted spaces… So many unique settings to bring your dream event to life, whether it's a wedding in Provence, a high-end seminar or a family celebration.</span></p> 
<p class="font_7 wixui-rich-text__text" style="text-align:center; font-size:15px;"><span class="color_44 wixui-rich-text__text">The Domaine de Valbonne is a rare, preserved, and emotionally charged place. A place where you feel supported, inspired… and which leaves no one indifferent.</span></p> 
<p class="font_7 wixui-rich-text__text" style="text-align:center; font-size:15px;">&nbsp;</p> 
<p class="font_7 wixui-rich-text__text" style="text-align:center; font-size:15px;"><span class="color_44 wixui-rich-text__text">See you very soon!</span></p> 
