#provence" class="gallery-item-visible gallery-item gallery-item-preloaded" style="width:100%;height:100%" data-hook="gallery-item-image-img" loading="lazy"/></picture></div></div></div></div></div><div data-id="b64b3246-2490-43a1-9c24-e81d51aacd89_5" class="item-link-wrapper" data-idx="5" data-hook="item-link-wrapper" tabindex="-1"><div class="gallery-item-container item-container-regular has-custom-focus visible clickable" id="pgib64b3246249043a19c24e81d51aacd89_5_5" data-hash="b64b3246-2490-43a1-9c24-e81d51aacd89_5" data-id="b64b3246-2490-43a1-9c24-e81d51aacd89_5" data-idx="5" data-hook="item-container" style="overflow-y:hidden;position:absolute;bottom:auto;margin:0;top:330px;left:662px;right:auto;width:318px;height:318px;overflow:hidden;transition:opacity .2s ease;opacity:0;display:none"><div data-idx="5" id="item-action-b64b3246-2490-43a1-9c24-e81d51aacd89_5" class="item-action" tabindex="-1" data-hook="item-action" aria-label="There is something truly timeless about an English wedding in Provence... 🇬🇧🤍

Jessica &amp; Stuart chose to gather their favourite people for an entire wedding weekend, where elegance met simplicity, and every moment felt beautifully effortless.

From laughter-filled preparations to a sun-drenched ceremony, an aperitif beneath the olive trees and a dance floor that stayed alive late into the night… this is exactly what we love about celebrations at Domaine de Valbonne.

Thank you, Jessica &amp; Stuart, for trusting us with such a beautiful chapter of your story. Wishing you a lifetime of love, laughter and adventures together.

With love,

Domaine de Valbonne

An elegant English destination wedding in Provence, surrounded by olive trees, sunshine and the timeless charm of a private Provençal estate. Provence, just as it should be.

