#provencestylewedding 
#villagelife 
#slowwedding 
#authenticwedding 
#provencewedding 
#weekendwedding" role="button"></div><div><div data-hook="item-wrapper" class="gallery-item-wrapper visible cube-type-fill [object Object]" id="item-wrapper-5bd61ff3-9f89-4a80-9004-7558d3b50ca8_14" style="background-color:none;height:318px;width:318px;margin:0px"><div class="gallery-item-content item-content-regular image-item gallery-item-visible gallery-item gallery-item-preloaded   " data-hook="image-item" style="width:318px;height:318px;margin-top:0;margin-left:0"><picture><img src="https://instagram.fsdv2-1.fna.fbcdn.net/v/t51.82787-15/611256810_18083297129132449_5711576885268090684_n.jpg?stp=dst-jpg_e35_tt6&amp;_nc_cat=107&amp;ccb=7-5&amp;_nc_sid=18de74&amp;efg=eyJlZmdfdGFnIjoiQ0FST1VTRUxfSVRFTS5iZXN0X2ltYWdlX3VybGdlbi5DMyJ9&amp;_nc_ohc=v6T7zDWItXcQ7kNvwFmTXQb&amp;_nc_oc=AdpQWJr0Ruqg2wD4I9l-sT-lTPqEEGnVPcXQClqy91MoEnsUIJurED5NpqKVhyISdwI&amp;_nc_zt=23&amp;_nc_ht=instagram.fsdv2-1.fna&amp;edm=ANo9K5cEAAAA&amp;_nc_gid=v2l0yZvve0SAbE0uZndFpw&amp;_nc_tpa=Q5bMBQK_gtKIDiYPo3H3NDgWV1NC4HgcVQDCCjCP5xPJzlBeiPHZuKmBVdWYnrxO1C5z9aMUy3S3yGa9&amp;oh=00_AQKDYOdPfQIXSzMzFLECSaYSWNbJLRrpoZBBQ5QeUlDNaA&amp;oe=6AAB62AD" alt="At our place, people arrive on Friday.
